{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"510307","name":"重光临晨","desc":"重光临晨卡牌","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/11/03/258999284/e235d4d4e7465578cc0dbbea9287eec0_6641422055114375662.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"基础信息","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"card_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"moduleName\":\"基础信息\",\"layout_\":\"left\",\"name\":\"重光临晨\",\"common_img\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/11/03/258999284/e235d4d4e7465578cc0dbbea9287eec0_7048520329219710703.png\",\"gold_img\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/11/03/258999284/524439a00c61ea30139e9c88f9682762_1743247468664155697.gif\",\"life\":3,\"life_bg\":3,\"energy\":0,\"energy_bg\":0,\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"类型：\",\"value\":[\"装备牌\"]},{\"key\":\"标签：\",\"value\":[\"天赋，魔导\"]},{\"key\":\"获取：\",\"value\":[\"卡牌商店购买获取\"]},{\"key\":\"花费：\",\"value\":[\"3\"]}],\"baseInfoSwitchDisabled\":false}","style":""}],"id":"1","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"效果描述","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e快速行动\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;快速行动：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;执行了一次快速行动后，我方可以继续进行其他行动。\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;只有执行了一次战斗行动后，才会轮到对方行动。\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e：装备给我方的\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e法尔伽\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e，生成\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e烈风终坠\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;烈风终坠：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;事件牌\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;费用：2\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;为法尔伽\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;挑选\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;一项技能，在下个回合开始移除我方1个骰子，切换至法尔伽，并准备对应技能：\u0026lt;br\u0026gt;造成6点\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(54, 207, 201)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;风元素伤害\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;。\u0026lt;br\u0026gt;或\u0026lt;br\u0026gt;根据我方角色附属对应的元素附魔。然后进行2次「普通攻击」。\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e。\u003cbr/\u003e我方\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e法尔伽\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e使用「普通攻击」后，赋予我方手牌中1张\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e烈风终坠\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;烈风终坠：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;事件牌\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;费用：2\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;为法尔伽\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;挑选\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;一项技能，在下个回合开始移除我方1个骰子，切换至法尔伽，并准备对应技能：\u0026lt;br\u0026gt;造成6点\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(54, 207, 201)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;风元素伤害\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;。\u0026lt;br\u0026gt;或\u0026lt;br\u0026gt;根据我方角色附属对应的元素附魔。然后进行2次「普通攻击」。\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e费用降低\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e。\u003cbr/\u003e（牌组中包含法尔伽，才能加入牌组）\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"2","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"卡牌故事","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e法尔伽·重光临晨\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e「虽然我觉得所有读者应该都能轻而易举地看出这一点，但原作第一卷里提到的『魔女资格考试之终阶试炼』其实只有想要成为大魔女的孩子们才能参加。换句话说，也就是『魔女资格考试』一定要有魔女。总不至于真的有人借着资格考试的名义，自己给自己出个已经完成的题目，然后到处骗酒喝吧？」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"3","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false,\"without_border\":true}\n","style":""}],"id":"6632","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":true,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"6633","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_bor